["ab"]  {:.<8?} on a &str
["ab"....]  {:.<8} on format!("{:?}")

same spec, eight different Debug impls:
  i32          [42......]
  f64          [1.5.....]
  bool         [true....]
  &str         ["ab"]
  char         ['a']
  String       ["ab"]
  Option<u8>   [Some(1.......)]
  Vec<u8>      [[1......., 2.......]]

containers forward the spec to their elements:
  Vec<u8>   [[1....., 2.....]]
  Vec<&str> [["a", "b"]]

precision, on the same eight-character string:
  {:.3}  [abc]
  {:.3?} ["abcdefgh"]
